\code{filter_snps(min_maf = 0.05)} (and without LD pruning, which would remove
exactly the pattern you want to see). The number of pairs grows quickly
with the number of SNPs, so if there are more than \code{max_snps} SNPs, an
evenly spaced subset is used.
